# Dark Endurance on an Ornithopter that is not blocking costs its full {1}{B}: paid with Mox Jet and Mox Pearl, the Ornithopter is
# 2/2 with flying and indestructible until end of turn, and a Mox Ruby, not needed, stays untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Dark Endurance
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dark Endurance.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Indestructible
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Tapped = false
